 graphy that may be used by the University for promotional purposes. If yo
 u would not like to be in any pictures\, please speak to a Museum staff m
 ember and they will inform assigned photographers of your request. If you
  see that your image has been used in error\, please reach out to iumaa@i
 u.edu (mailto:iumaa@iu.edu) to request that it be taken down.
